-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Rollback:** Its release history has only two production versions, v5.0.0 (healthy) and v5.1.0 (degraded). v5.0.0 is now live in all three regions.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2) is open for payments-api, and the on-call engineer has been paged. It records what happened and the rollback, and says the next steps are to confirm the recovery holds and find what broke in v5.1.0.\n\nI found payments-api by guessing names. If there are other payments services, like a worker or gateway, that also got this morning's deploy, give me their names and I'll check them.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and the release history.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0154KhtNgKfzotqffdKteP8P", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0172GxP4aiLxYduJP8ckDTUc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "There's no service named exactly \"payments\". I'll look through existing incidents for the right service name.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0125qYL5wjTvKWe2mZFFG1QQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.8}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "No hints there. I'll try a few common names using read-only status checks.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_011betLsuHhHiPKEEYmCfbXK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence"